From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] drm/msm/dsi: own complete AA569 command groups

Experimental opt-in SM8750/AA569 single DSI0 path. Preserve vendor DMA
boundaries without pending state between calls. No hardware Tested-by.

